<h1>Pirate Writings</h1>

<i>Pirate Writings: Tales of Fantasy, Mystery & Science Fiction</i> is
a quarterly semi-prozine issued in small-bedsheet format. 

<p>
A one year subscription (4 issues) is currently $15.00. Write to:
<pre>
    Pirate Writings Publishing
    SUBSCRIPTIONS
    53 Whitman Ave.
    Islip, NY 11751
</pre>
<p>
